  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project to Expand and Assess the Fair Food Program (FFP) Model for Promotion of Human Rights and Labor Rights Protections in International Agricultural Supply Chains</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to (1) increase labor and human rights protections and compliance with labor laws on flower farms, and (2) increase understanding of factors affecting the scalability and replicability of the FFP model in pilot countries.</narrative>
  </description>
